☕ The Daily Grind --- Café Website

A modern full-stack café ordering website where customers can browse the
menu, register/login, manage their cart, place orders, and make online
payments using Razorpay.

✨ Features

🔐 User registration and login

☕ Dynamic café menu

🛒 Add to cart and cart management

📦 Order placement and order management

💳 Razorpay payment integration

🗄️ SQLite database

🔑 Authenticated API routes

📱 Responsive café interface

⚡ RESTful backend APIs

👤 User-specific cart and orders

🛠️ Tech Stack

Frontend

HTML5

CSS3

JavaScript

Axios

Backend

Node.js

Express.js

CORS

REST APIs

Database

SQLite

Payment

Razorpay

