🚀 Application Flow

Register / Login
       ↓
   Browse Menu
       ↓
   Add to Cart
       ↓
    Checkout
       ↓
Razorpay Payment
       ↓
Order Verification
       ↓
Order Confirmation

⚙️ Installation

1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/the-daily-grind-cafe.git
cd the-daily-grind-cafe

2. Install backend dependencies

cd server
npm install

3. Configure environment variables

Create a .env file inside the server directory:

PORT=5001
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=your_razorpay_test_key
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your_razorpay_test_secret

Never commit .env or payment secrets to GitHub.

4. Start the backend

npm start

The API will run on:

http://localhost:5001

5. Open the frontend

Open index.html in your browser, or use your preferred local
development server.

💳 Razorpay

The project is designed to use Razorpay Test Mode during development.

Payment flow:

Checkout
   ↓
Create Razorpay Order
   ↓
Razorpay Checkout
   ↓
Payment
   ↓
Server-side Signature Verification
   ↓
Update Order/Payment Status

For production, use proper Razorpay account verification and live
credentials.

🗄️ Database

SQLite is used to store application data such as:

Users

Menu items

Cart items

Orders

Order items

Payment information

The database is initialized by the backend when the server starts.

🔒 Security

Keep Razorpay secret keys on the backend only.

Never commit .env to GitHub.

Use authenticated requests for protected resources.

Verify Razorpay payments on the server.

Do not trust payment status sent directly from the frontend.

🧪 Development

Start the backend:

cd server
npm start

Expected output:

Database initialized
Server running on port 5001

API base URL:

http://localhost:5001/api

